SUMMARY:Rev Tor’s 15th Annual Dead Of Winter Jam Featuring Dead Man’s W
 altz & Friends
LOCATION:Colonial Theatre\, 111 South St\, Pittsfield\, MA 01201
DESCRIPTION:Drawing from the Northeast festival scene\, Dead Man’s Waltz 
 brings seasoned musicians together for an adventurous trip through the Gra
 teful Dead’s expansive songbook. Familiar melodies leave room for unexpe
 cted turns as the band follows the music wherever it leads. It’s a spiri
 ted celebration of songs built to be explored\, shared and heard anew.\nht
 tps://www.berkshiretheatregroup.org/event/rev-tors-15th-annual-dead-of-win
 ter-jam/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
