SUMMARY:Magic Tree House: The Knight at Dawn KIDS
LOCATION:Colonial Theatre\, 111 South St\, Pittsfield\, MA 01201
DESCRIPTION:Fresh from their adventure with the dinosaurs\, Jack and Annie 
 return to the magic tree house and open a book about the Middle Ages. When
  Annie wishes she could visit the castle on its pages\, the siblings are w
 hisked back to the age of knights. Curious about the mysterious Black Knig
 ht and his quest\, they set off through a castle full of surprises\, from 
 a grand medieval feast to secret tunnels and dancing suits of armor. As th
 ey search for a way home\, Jack and Annie discover the power of hope and w
 hat it really means to be brave.\nhttps://www.berkshiretheatregroup.org/ev
 ent/magic-tree-house-the-knight-at-dawn-kids/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: 
 https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.berkshiretheatregroup.org/event/magic-tree-house-the-knight
 -at-dawn-kids/
END:VEVENT
