DESCRIPTION:From the feel-good charm of “Brown Eyed Girl” to the soulfu
 l pull of “Into the Mystic\,” Van Morrison’s songs have a way of sta
 ying with you. Moondance brings that extraordinary catalog to the stage in
  a tribute concert celebrating the unmistakable sound and spirit of Van th
 e Man.\nhttps://www.berkshiretheatregroup.org/event/moondance/\nFrom Pushp
 in Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
